[00:00.444]I'm at a payphone trying to call home
{"我在公用电话亭试图打给家"}
[00:04.437]All of my change I spent on you
{"所有零钱都为你花光"}
[00:07.944]Where have the times gone
{"那些时光都去了何方"}
[00:09.941]Baby it's all wrong, where are the plans we made for two?
{"亲爱的全乱套了 当初的二人计划在哪"}
[00:16.197]Yeah, I, I know it's hard to remember
{"是啊 我知道很难回想"}
[00:19.193]The people we used to be
{"我们曾经的模样"}
[00:21.190]It's even harder to picture
{"更难想象的是现在"}
[00:23.198]That you're not here next to me
{"你不在我身旁"}
[00:25.195]You say it's too late to make it
{"你说现在补救已太迟"}
[00:26.939]But is it too late to try?
{"但尝试难道也为时已晚"}
[00:28.947]And in our time that you wasted
{"在你挥霍的时光里"}
[00:30.943]All of our bridges burned down
{"我们所有退路都烧尽"}
[00:32.940]I've wasted my nights
{"我虚度了每个夜晚"}
[00:34.937]You turned out the lights
{"你亲手熄灭灯光"}
[00:37.189]Now I'm paralyzed
{"如今我动弹不得"}
[00:39.442]Still stuck in that time when we called it love
{"仍困在那段所谓爱情的时光"}
[00:42.892]But even the sun sets in paradise
{"可就算天堂也有日落时分"}
[00:47.397]I'm at a payphone trying to call home
{"我在公用电话亭试图打给家"}
[00:51.403]All of my change I spent on you
{"所有零钱都为你花光"}
[00:55.397]Where have the times gone
{"那些时光都去了何方"}
[00:57.651]Baby it's all wrong, where are the plans we made for two?
{"亲爱的全乱套了 当初的二人计划在哪"}
[01:02.897]If happy ever after did exist
{"如果真存在幸福美满结局"}
[01:07.143]I would still be holding you like this
{"我此刻仍会这样抱着你"}
[01:11.149]All those fairytales are full of shit
{"所有童话故事都是放屁"}
[01:14.901]One more ****ing love song i'll be sick
{"再听一首该死情歌我就要吐"}
[01:20.332]You turned your back on tomorrow
{"你背弃了明天"}
[01:22.329]Cause you forgot yesterday
{"只因遗忘了昨天"}
[01:24.079]I gave you my love to borrow
{"我曾借予你我的爱"}
[01:26.076]But you just gave it away
{"你却随手抛弃"}
[01:28.085]You can't expect me to be fine
{"别指望我能若无其事"}
[01:30.082]I don't expect you to care
{"我不奢求你会在意"}
[01:32.078]I know I've said it before
{"虽然我已说过"}
[01:33.834]But all of our bridges burned down
{"但我们之间桥梁尽毁"}
[01:36.084]I've wasted my nights
{"我虚度了长夜"}
[01:38.080]You turned out the lights
{"你熄灭了灯火"}
[01:40.078]Now I'm paralyzed
{"如今我动弹不得"}
[01:42.018]Still stuck in that time when we called it love
{"仍困在那段所谓爱情的时光里"}
[01:45.952]But even the sun sets in paradise
{"可即便天堂也有日落时分"}
[01:50.456]I'm at a payphone trying to call home
{"我在投币电话前试图拨通家"}
[01:54.205]All of my change I spent on you
{"所有零钱都为你耗尽"}
[01:58.199]Where have the times gone
{"那些时光去了哪里"}
